SUMMARY:An Evening with David Sedaris
LOCATION:Colonial Theatre\, 111 South St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:With sardonic wit and incisive social observation\, David Sedar
 is has become one of America’s preeminent humor writers. Beloved for his
  personal essays and short stories\, Sedaris is the bestselling author of 
 Barrel Fever\, Holidays on Ice\, Naked\, Me Talk Pretty One Day\, Dress Yo
 ur Family in Corduroy and Denim\, When You Are Engulfed in Flames\, Let’
 s Explore Diabetes with Owls\, Calypso\, The Best of Me and Happy-Go-Lucky
 \, among others. His books have sold more than 16 million copies worldwide
  and been translated into 32 languages.\nhttps://www.berkshiretheatregroup
 .org/event/an-evening-with-david-sedaris/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: http
 s://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/event/an-evening-with-david-sedar
 is/
END:VEVENT
